==== hyperbricks yaml {!{images}} ====
images:
  - type: images
  - attributes:
      decoding: async
  - class: galleryimage bordered
  - directory: hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/
  - height: "10"
  - id: '#galleryimage_'
  - loading: lazy
  - width: "100"
==== explainer ====
CSS class for styling the image
==== expected json ====
{
  "Alt": "",
  "Class": "galleryimage bordered",
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "ConfigType": "<IMAGES>",
  "Directory": "hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/",
  "Enclose": "",
  "ExtraAttributes": {
    "decoding": "async"
  },
  "Height": 10,
  "HyperBricksFile": "",
  "HyperBricksKey": "",
  "HyperBricksPath": "",
  "Id": "#galleryimage_",
  "IsStatic": false,
  "Loading": "lazy",
  "MetaDocDescription": "",
  "Quality": 0,
  "Title": "",
  "Width": 100
}

==== expected output ====
<img src="static/images/cute_cat_w100_h10.jpg" width="100" height="10" class="galleryimage bordered" id="#galleryimage_0" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
